OL,3,GNEWSAElection rules for foreign
OL,4,Anationals should be reconsidered, MSPs
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FA law allowing foreign nationals with
OL,8,Ftemporary permission to stay in the UK
OL,9,Fto stand in Scottish elections should
OL,10,Fbe reconsidered, a Holyrood committee
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FIt follows the election in May of Green
OL,14,FMSP Q Manivannan, whose visa was due to
OL,15,Fexpire at the end of the year.
OL,17,FThe Standards, Procedures and Public
OL,18,FAppointments Committee said the
OL,19,F"rationale" for allowing people with
OL,20,Flimited leave to remain and stand for
OL,21,Felection to councils and Holyrood was
OL,22,F"simply not clear".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
